  "goodToKnow": "Die Stilllegung is a shutdown or decommissioning: die Stilllegung eines Bergwerks, eines Atomkraftwerks, einer Bahnstrecke. Since the 1996 spelling reform it has three l (still + legen). In 2018, Prosper-Haniel in Bottrop, Germany's last hard-coal mine, was stillgelegt, and many old pits like Zollverein in Essen became museums and World Heritage sites. Plural: die Stilllegungen."
